      "writtenOn": "2025-04-17T16:43:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Non-zero check works for single bit features like MMX, SSE, SSE2, SSE3, SSSE3 and SSE4_1 but we need to check it actually equals _BITS for AVX2 and AVX512\n\nSo I think it\u0027s better to keep them consistent by checking the \u0026 result is actually equal to _BITS",
